Java Coding Exam: SimpleAdventure

A simple Java project that demonstrates object-oriented programming concepts through characters and items in an adventure setting.

Features

Create and manage Person objects.

Create different types of Item, including Food and Weapon.

Weapons can attack characters.

Food can heal characters.

Demonstrates inheritance and polymorphism.

Uses instanceof for type checking.

Technologies

Java

Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)

How to Run

Compile and run the Main class using any Java IDE or a Java compiler.